				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					4.74
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτοισιν αἱ. διὰ ῥινῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					1.12
				</span></i>
			.</div>
